<title>AUSTRIA: Brau Union merges Sopron, Martfu brewers.</title>
<headline>Brau Union merges Sopron, Martfu brewers.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian beverage group Brau Union AG said on Thursday it would merge its two Hungarian breweries Martfu and Sopron and would offer to buy out Martfu shares at 206 schillings per share.</p>
<p>The company said in a brief statement it would reveal further details of the merger at a news conference in Budapest at 1300 GMT. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 254</p>
